  "goodToKnow": "Der Dokumentarfilm is a documentary film, often shortened to die Doku: eine Doku über den Klimawandel. A feature film is ein Spielfilm. German public broadcasters like ARD, ZDF and arte air many documentaries, and Leipzig hosts DOK Leipzig, one of the oldest documentary festivals. Werner Herzog is also famous for his documentaries. Plural: die Dokumentarfilme."
